# ── Supabase (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Without these, the app runs in self-contained DEMO mode (seeded
# leaderboard + local referral simulation). Add both to go fully
# live with real, cross-user registrations and a shared leaderboard.
#
# Get them in your Supabase project → Settings → API:
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL      = Project URL
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = Project API keys → anon / public
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (local) and/or add the two vars in Vercel
# → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
